        <head>HOWLEY WARD.</head>
        <p>HOWLEY WARD.</p>
        <p>James Cannel! (C), 80 Academy-st., physician and surgeon, eroposed by William Bolton, seconded by John Evans, assented to by James Pincock Oxley, Thomas Meredith Hales, John Whitley, Joseph Birchall, Robert Anderton, Joseph Hedgecock,Alfred Moores,and Charles Danicle.—Also proposed by John Dewhurst, seconded by Samuel Davies, assented to by James Spencer, William Lee, William Clare, Peter Naylor, Thomas Ashton, John Burgess, Herbert Henry Cook, and Thomas Clancy. The following is a table of the candidates chosen up to last night, the asterisk denoting the retiring councillors:—</p>
