      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-10-26_WidnesExaminer_art0102" n="art0102">
        <p>NOTICE TO CONTRIBUTORS AND CORRESPON- DENTS. All letters to the Editor and contlibutions of news should be written on one side of the paper only. The name and address of correspondents .must in al cases be given, not necessarily for publication but as a guarantee of good faith. *** We do not bold ourselves responsibl3 for the opinions expressed in letters to the Editor, which are understood to embody only the views of the writers.</p>
        <p>3. A. LENNON.—Received.</p>
        <p>____—__=----- ixttero to Mr eDttor.</p>
        <p>ARRINoToN CHRISTIAN ENDEAVOUR CONVENTION. Sir,—Xllow me t 4 heartily thank you for the excellent • report which you gave last Saturday of the Christkan Endeavour Convention held the previous Saturday. I feel quite sure that the report would be much appreci- ated by the Christian Endeavourers of he district, and YOU will have the satisfaction of knowing that you have helped forward a good cause.—l am, dear sir,very</p>
